    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, I woke up in a strange building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's more, the monster was lurking in this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That monster will attack you as you try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one way for you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do not give up until the end, and escape while cooperating with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By carefully examining the map, you may get the clues and items you need to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You examine shelves, move boxes, and manipulate levers and other contraptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By doing so you can progress in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty of this game depends on your ideas and inspiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be saved whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you make a mistake, you can easily try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this game is for all ages, so anyone can play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I sincerely hope you will play this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, I woke up in a strange building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's more, the monster was lurking in this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That monster will attack you as you try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one way for you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do not give up until the end, and escape while cooperating with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By carefully examining the map, you may get the clues and items you need to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You examine shelves, move boxes, and manipulate levers and other contraptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By doing so you can progress in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty of this game depends on your ideas and inspiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be saved whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you make a mistake, you can easily try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this game is for all ages, so anyone can play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I sincerely hope you will play this game.</p>",
